      "comment": "Hard to go past CHANDRA (6) who will be well fancied here. Made debut at each way odds at Northam and after settling well back flashed home and just missed. Can only be improved and meets a very moderate line-up. Looks hard to hold out again. SOVEREIGN ROCK (5) bounced straight to the front from the rails draw and led into the straight but emptied and weakened out if it to finish eighth over 1200m at Bunbury. This easier and will take catching. LACEY MARIE (10) returned from a spell two weeks ago when she was beaten 4.5 lengths into seventh over 1000m at Northam. Fitter so expect a better run this time. MAXINE'S WISH (4) was solid fresh and fitter but has had a lot of chances.",
